{"3879330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mindaro", "steam_appid": 3879330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>In Development</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>Burning Boats Studios</strong>, an independent game development team based in Mexico. We're thrilled to announce <strong>Mindaro</strong>, our ambitious project currently in active development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/aa52b55144891d9765657f8beb573713.avif?t=1776119132\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras_big/aa52b55144891d9765657f8beb573713.avif?t=1776119132 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small, dedicated team, our passion is to craft an engaging and polished gaming experience that resonates with a wide audience. We believe in creating games that are not only fun to play but also contribute positively to the gaming community we're proud to be a part of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your</strong> <strong>feedback</strong> is invaluable to us. We openly welcome any questions, suggestions, or constructive criticism as we continue to refine Mindaro. Thank you for following our progress; your support means the world. If you haven't already, please consider adding Mindaro to your <strong>wishlist</strong> – it truly helps us on our journey to launch a game we believe everyone will enjoy.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“You are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1776119132\" width=308 height=333 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>I WANT YOU TO JOIN THIS EXPEDITION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>                                                                                                                   </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5c5b0b86c6f9a052c60ef79636a16ce9.avif?t=1776119132\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.poster.avif?t=1776119132\" width=670 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.webm?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.mp4?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what's on the bottom of this abyss, descending through layers as deep as your courage will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>                                                                                                                   </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/cf8a850ea698fd5372df2f3621812ab8.avif?t=1776119132\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ac1cc0dbe76b79e52a13ac4a98aa8d69.poster.avif?t=1776119132\" width=670 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ac1cc0dbe76b79e52a13ac4a98aa8d69.webm?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ac1cc0dbe76b79e52a13ac4a98aa8d69.mp4?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by how everything looks; it has survived this long for a reason, and it's waiting for you to come down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>                                                                                                                   </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/24350d0d86f9ef97dd73704f4afc5780.avif?t=1776119132\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/6ae856f17087cc6734e945e3960c6c3b.poster.avif?t=1776119132\" width=670 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/6ae856f17087cc6734e945e3960c6c3b.webm?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/6ae856f17087cc6734e945e3960c6c3b.mp4?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to explore, learn everything you can to help future Pioneers with the knowledge to conquer the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>                                                                                                                   </u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/ec255869862e717acfa368e783d10ea3.avif?t=1776119132\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/4f9981a5af97e09a47a40774abbc559b.poster.avif?t=1776119132\" width=670 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/4f9981a5af97e09a47a40774abbc559b.webm?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/4f9981a5af97e09a47a40774abbc559b.mp4?t=1776119132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you can find to your disposal, and remember to secure the classified documents to be sent back to base – the fate of the mission depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“You are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1776119132\" width=308 height=333 /></span></p><h2 cla